functions:
public pre: bitstring -> bitstring

agents: A B s

knowledge: 
A knows A B s sk(A,s).
B knows A B s sk(B,s).
s knows A B s sk(A,s) sk(B,s).

choreo:

A->B: A.
B: new NB0.
B->A: scrypt((A,NB0),sk(B,s)).
A: new NA.
A->s: (A,B,NA,scrypt((A,NB0),sk(B,s))).
s: new KAB.
s->A: scrypt((NA,B,KAB,scrypt((KAB,NB0,A),sk(B,s))),sk(A,s)).
A->B: scrypt((KAB,NB0,A),sk(B,s)).
B: new NB.
B->A: scrypt(NB,KAB).
A->B: scrypt(pre(NB),KAB).

A authenticates B on NB. #true
B authenticates A on pre(NB). #true
NB secret between A B. #true
end